Exercise: sa-cli-review (chapter 2 lab)

A colleague copied the end of servera's log into server.log after the
inventory service stopped. Investigate it from the command line and save
your answers in this folder:

  time.txt            the current time on workstation, as HH:MM (24-hour)
  last5.txt           the last five lines of server.log
  lines.txt           the line count of server.log, as wc -l prints it
  servera-kernel.txt  the kernel release servera is running

Then check your work:  lab grade sa-cli-review
